    "name": "Home Social Isolation Monitor",
    "description": "Integration machine that reads combined output signals from the Home Medication Cost Barrier Monitor [2011:2015] and the Home Transportation Barrier Monitor [2015:2019] to detect social isolation driven by access barriers. For low- and medium-income adults managing chronic conditions at home, the combination of medication cost barriers and transportation failures systematically restricts social participation, community connection, and human contact \u2014 accelerating depression, cognitive decline, and self-neglect. Output at [2035:2039] is available to downstream care coordination systems.",
